    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Alchemist</strong></p><p><strong>“You’re not powerful yet. You’re noticeable.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 1, you learn the first dangerous lesson: <strong>matter listens</strong>.</p><p>You are not generating value yet. You are accelerating reactions, shortening timelines, and making crude but effective substitutions when a system would otherwise stall out.</p><p>People start bringing you problems that smell like “this should not work.”</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain proficiency with <strong>Alchemist’s Supplies</strong></li><li>When crafting basic alchemical items, the time required is halved</li><li>You can identify substances, compounds, and chemical hazards in minutes instead of hours</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Production Reliability:</strong> once per Strategic Turn, when your faction spends <strong>Economy OP</strong> on production, infrastructure, or supply stabilization, reduce that spend by <strong>1</strong> (minimum 1)</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> every use leaves evidence — fumes, scarcity elsewhere, suspicious efficiency, or a process that now depends on you.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"alchT1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Production Reliability</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">When faction spends Economy OP on production / infrastructure / supply, reduce spend by 1 (min 1).</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
